      "name": "Stunned",
      "kind": "condition",
      "description": "A Stunned creature is Incapacitated, staggers at half Speed, and can speak only falteringly. It loses applicable Dexterity and dodge defenses and suffers a -2 Armor Class penalty, in place of attacker Advantage. It does not automatically drop held objects.",
